/task
1
Using hypothetical inputs only, assess a software company described as fast-growing and currently unprofitable. Build a decision framework covering evidence needed, unit economics, cash runway, concentration, governance, downside cases, valuation uncertainty, mandate fit, and reasons not to invest. Do not recommend a trade.
